``Hardly and trans fatty acids occur in Nature, so the human body has
never developed the mechanisms necessary to use them.  Today, almost
all processed fat and oil products, cooking oils, margarines, and fats
used in breads, cookies, candies, chocolates, frozen dinners, pies,
